mately5.119-5.241V." (at 12 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "562c755e-ee42-416e-a129-a678b712ec8a")) (text "AFE5V precision UV implemented on sheet23; U650 large-hysteresis UV output unused. No late undervoltage trip is assumed safe." (at 12 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "2a15d5cb-6426-4c66-8c2a-1a600a07a7f8")) (text "Rail-window faults force acquisition reset/powerdown and open bias; they do not physically disconnect signal electrodes." (at 12 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b235eb9a-e0d5-4b92-bb3a-ec993ff8ded5")))